  "detail_text": "The U.S. Army Corps of Engineers, Norfolk District is seeking eligible firms capable of performing all necessary labor, supervision, management, transportation, tools, equipment, materials, and supplies to perform cleaning and prevention activities of the Millennium Columbarium at Arlington National Cemetery in Virginia. THIS IS A SOURCES SOUGHT NOTICE ONLY. THIS IS NOT A REQUEST FOR PROPOSALS. THERE IS NOT A SOLICITATION. NEITHER A SPECIFICATION NOR DRAWINGS ARE AVAILABLE AT THIS TIME. Contractors should review attached Notice and provide the information requested in order to respond.",
